# Everything heavy, generated, or personal stays out of the repository. What is
# tracked here is the source of the speech sidecar and the tools around it -
# about 140 KB. The working directory it runs in is tens of gigabytes.

# Python environments. A venv records its own absolute path in its launcher
# shims, so it cannot be moved between directories - see README for how to
# point this folder at one you already have.
venv/
venv-qwen/
.uvcache/
__pycache__/

# Model weights and the caches they are downloaded into.
hf/
models/
modelscope/

# CosyVoice is a separate project with its own licence. It is cloned next to
# these scripts, never vendored into this repository.
CosyVoice/

# The reference voice, and anything derived from it.
#
# This is the one file the whole clone is built from. It is yours, it is not
# ours to publish, and the repository is deliberately without it - the scripts
# expect you to put it here yourself. reference_text*.txt are cached
# transcripts of it, so they are the sample in another form and stay out too.
xamples/
examples/
ref_og.wav
reference_text*.txt

# Generated speech: baked voice packs, studio takes, probe output.
pack/
pack-*/
studio_out/
*.wav

# Runtime state. Written by the sidecar's own console and full of absolute
# paths from the machine that wrote it.
sidecar_qwen_config.json

*.log
